        "Id": "a61d02c8-ab01-47d0-a4f6-054e46da458f",
        "Type": "usercreated",
        "Title": "Death of the Party",
        "Location": "LOCATION_EDGY_FOX",
        "PublicId": "129603416057",
        "ScenePath": "assembly:/_pro/scenes/missions/edgy/mission_fox/scene_fox_contractcreation.entity",
        "TileImage": "$($repository 1af43e4a-5b91-45f4-8374-0a4e059adacc).Image",
        "Description": "Agent 47, we recently received a noise complaint from neighbors about a party happening at a nightclub operating out of an unused power plant. Unfortunately, there also happen to be ICA agents that will recognize you on sight, but their presence is entirely coincidental and should serve only as a minor obstacle for this mission. In order to kill this party, quickly and quietly eliminate the DJs, and ensure this is the last party they can peform for.\rFinally, our clients ask that you keep civil.",
